Note: Phase 45 REQ-BEAT-TEST-04 — cross-file boundary HELPER (pragma-OFF).
Note: This file does NOT enable beat-true-to-sig. Per D-04 the pragma bit is
Note: per-DECLARING-file, so every (beat N) call below sees multiplier 1.0
Note: regardless of whether the importer has the pragma enabled.

proc bumpBeat (Beat: b)
    Note: ignores its argument; always constructs (beat 1) under THIS file's
    Note: pragma bit (off) — so the result is always raw quarters = 1.0.
    return (beat 1)
end proc

proc helperRawBeat ()
    return (beat 0.5)
end proc

